result
result-*

# CI reports (test:* jobs write these next to the suites)
junit.xml
coverage/
frontend/bundle-size.json

# Local planning notes
docs/superpowers/plans/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Biscotos hardening (docs/SECURITY_AUDIT.md). The repo is PUBLIC: anything
# committed is readable forever. Synthetic test fixtures live under fixtures/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Secrets / environment — only .env.example (fake values) is tracked
.env.*
!.env.example
*.env
secrets/
*.secret
# AI coach provider login cache (docker-compose.yml mounts it next to data/): a live refresh token
coach-auth/

